{
  "name": "Fencer Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have only a single [One-Handed] melee weapon equipped to a [Hand Slot]. Your [Attack Power] becomes [Weapon's (Attack Power) x2]. During the first round of a scene, you gain a +1 bonus to [Speed].</p>\n<p>(SR2): The bonus to speed becomes permanent, not just during the first scene.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style that emphasizes attack power and mobility, gracefully manipulating a weapon held in one hand.</p>",
